--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ hidden friend not found by ordinary lookup: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ found by argument-dependent lookup: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ declared at namespace scope: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
